window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>When my father tries to force me to marry one of his cronies, I run away to my half-brother's home.</p> <p>He's the black sheep of the family, a biker, not an Irish mobster. At the Satan's Sinners' MC compound, I find more than I bargained for.</p> <p>Not my brother, ironically, but a man who gives a whole other meaning to \"white knight.\"</p> <p>He's dark and mysterious, a seeker of answers and a finder of truths.</p> <p>Even better? He offers me an out, a shotgun wedding in Vegas.</p> <p>I just don't realize he has an ulterior motive.</p> <p>But he doesn't know I have one, too....</p> <p><i>MaryCat &amp; Digger's story<br> <br> A Five Points' Mob &amp; Dark and Dirty Sinners' MC Crossover</i></p>"; 
